    "Redirect TEID 0xA001 -> bpf_redirect(95, 0)",
    "Redirect TEID 0xA002 -> bpf_redirect(96, 0)",
    "Always return XDP_PASS for other traffic",
    "SEC(\"xdp\") and GPL license declaration"
